 *   passing reference canaries that established identified-object refusal and
 *   anonymous Color reference behavior.
 *
 *   NormalFix_CoreIdentity_AdversarialRefusal_Canary_v0_1_3.jsx
 *   SHA-256: b0f92c1754428d8d1d8ecf1bf7b391032f745bb7c2d1965d04b78a25f68f788b
 *
 *   NormalFix_AnonymousColorReference_Canary_v0_1_1.jsx
 *   SHA-256: ddb0f001ac3e183f5cf4120712a848275ca77557d17d3c5fa5cb693de568c71e
 *
 * v0.3 safety-amendment evidence:
